PTX LU+dec.cta+diff-cluster
"Two relaxed .cta atom.dec on one global location: can both read the initial value (a lost update)?"
{
x=2;
P0:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0             | P1@cta 1,cluster 1,gpu 0             ;
 atom.relaxed.cta.global.dec r0, x, 5 | atom.relaxed.cta.global.dec r1, x, 5 ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 2 /\ P1:r1 == 2)
